{
  "uid": "homelab-pantry-bot-usage",
  "title": "Pantry Bot — Usage",
  "description": "Live HA health and usage. Application counters are scraped from the HA API Service at /metrics; operational panels use kube-state-metrics and cAdvisor. REBUILT 2026-09-21: the previous version of this dashboard queried pantry_bot_engagement_actions_total, pantry_bot_engagement_failures_total, pantry_bot_boss_damage_total, pantry_bot_boss_outcomes_total, pantry_bot_messages_total, and pantry_bot_extension_requests_total. A full enumeration of every metric name currently in this Prometheus (/api/v1/label/__name__/values), cross-checked against a 7-day count_over_time() for each of those six names, found zero samples for any of them anywhere in the retention window -- not 'currently down', genuinely absent. This lines up with the pantry-bot monolith having been split into dedicated microservices (worker/dispatcher/gateway/api/site, all ~10 days old) around the same time; the old engagement/boss-battle counters were not carried forward under those names. The three custom counters that do exist today -- pantry_bot_commands_total, pantry_bot_runtime_claims_total, pantry_bot_runtime_completions_total -- are what this dashboard now uses. If a future PantryBot release restores richer engagement/boss-battle metrics under new names, extend this dashboard rather than re-adding the old expressions.",
  "tags": [
    "homelab",
    "twitch",
    "pantry-bot",
    "usage"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "editable": true,
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "15s",
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-24h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "",
        "skipUrlSync": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Current runtime activity",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Runtime claims (1h)",
      "description": "pantry_bot_runtime_claims_total: work items (kind=event/outbox) claimed off a lane for processing in the last hour, summed across every lane (worker, twitch.chat, twitch.channel_points, twitch.moderation).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "expr": "sum(increase(pantry_bot_runtime_claims_total[1h])) or vector(0)", "legendFormat": "claims" }
      ],
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "orientation": "auto", "textMode": "value_and_name", "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "text", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Runtime completions (1h)",
      "description": "pantry_bot_runtime_completions_total for the same lanes. Persistently trailing claims by a wide margin across a range longer than the lane's expected processing time is the honest signal of a stuck queue.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 6, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "expr": "sum(increase(pantry_bot_runtime_completions_total[1h])) or vector(0)", "legendFormat": "completions" }
      ],
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "orientation": "auto", "textMode": "value_and_name", "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "text", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Chat commands (1h)",
      "description": "pantry_bot_commands_total: successfully handled chat commands (gift, grab, pantry, pantrycommands, snack, steal, ...) in the last hour, from the chat-worker service.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 12, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "expr": "sum(increase(pantry_bot_commands_total[1h])) or vector(0)", "legendFormat": "commands" }
      ],
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "orientation": "auto", "textMode": "value_and_name", "colorMode": "background", "graphMode": "none", "justifyMode": "auto" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "text", "value": null }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "bargauge",
      "title": "Outstanding claims by lane (all-time claims minus completions)",
      "description": "Both are monotonic counters, so claims-total minus completions-total approximates the current backlog per lane assuming each claim eventually completes exactly once. A counter reset (pod restart) briefly understates this; treat a single dip as noise and a sustained climb as a real backlog.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 18, "y": 1 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "expr": "sum by (lane) (pantry_bot_runtime_claims_total) - on (lane) sum by (lane) (pantry_bot_runtime_completions_total)", "legendFormat": "{{lane}}" }
      ],
      "options": { "orientation": "horizontal", "displayMode": "gradient", "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "decimals": 0, "min": 0, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 5 }, { "color": "red", "value": 25 }] } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Runtime event flow (claims vs. completions, by lane)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Runtime claims by lane (15m rate)",
      "description": "kind=event is the chat-worker's internal event queue; kind=outbox with a twitch.* lane is the dispatcher's outbound-message outbox per Twitch API surface.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "expr": "sum by (kind, lane) (rate(pantry_bot_runtime_claims_total[15m]))", "legendFormat": "{{kind}}/{{lane}}" }
      ],
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true, "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "decimals": 3, "min": 0, "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }, "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 12, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": false } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Runtime completions by lane (15m rate)",
      "description": "Same lanes as the claims panel. A lane whose completion rate falls well below its claim rate for a sustained period is backing up.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "expr": "sum by (kind, lane) (rate(pantry_bot_runtime_completions_total[15m]))", "legendFormat": "{{kind}}/{{lane}}" }
      ],
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true, "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "decimals": 3, "min": 0, "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }, "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 12, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": false } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Chat command activity",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Commands by name (15m rate)",
      "description": "Successfully handled chat commands, split by command name, from the chat-worker service.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" }, "expr": "sum by (command) (rate(pantry_bot_commands_total[15m]))", "legendFormat": "{{command}}" }
      ],
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true, "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "decimals": 3, "min": 0, "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" }, "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 1, "fillOpacity": 12, "showPoints": "never", "spanNulls": false } }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "HA service health (live)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 23 },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Ready PantryBot pods",
      "description": "Current ready pods in the pantry-bot namespace, across every microservice (worker, dispatcher, gateway, api, sites, cloudflared, postgres).",
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum(kube_pod_status_ready{namespace=\"pantry-bot\",condition=\"true\"})", "legendFormat": "ready" }
      ],
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "textMode": "value_and_name" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "PantryBot container restarts",
      "description": "Restarts in the pantry-bot namespace; useful during failover and recovery.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 24 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (pod, container) (increase(kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total{namespace=\"pantry-bot\"}[1h]))", "legendFormat": "{{pod}}/{{container}}" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "PantryBot CPU and memory",
      "description": "Current resource use for pantry-bot pods from kubelet cAdvisor.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 24 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}" },
      "targets": [
        { "refId": "A", "expr": "sum by (pod) (rate(container_cpu_usage_seconds_total{namespace=\"pantry-bot\",container!=\"\",container!=\"POD\"}[5m]))", "legendFormat": "{{pod}} CPU" },
        { "refId": "B", "expr": "sum by (pod) (container_memory_working_set_bytes{namespace=\"pantry-bot\",container!=\"\",container!=\"POD\"})", "legendFormat": "{{pod}} memory" }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] }
    }
  ]
}
